            eprintln!("Warning: Camera {} has suspiciously round values - may be synthetic", camera_id);
        }
    }

    println!("\n✅ TC-INP-001: Camera intrinsics parsing validated");
    println!("   {} cameras with reasonable intrinsics", scene.cameras.len());
}

